 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Verbos con ter",
    "@en": "Verbs with ter"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**manter** (mantener), **obter** (obtener), **conter** (contener), **reter** (retener), **deter** (detener). Se conjugan igual que **ter**: **mantenho** (mantengo), **obténs** (obtienes), **obtém** (obtiene).",
     "@en": "**manter** (keep), **obter** (get), **conter** (contain), **reter** (retain), **deter** (stop). They are conjugated as **ter**: **mantenho** (maintenance), **obténs** (get), **obtém** (get)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "El prefijo cambia el sentido: **ter** (tener), **manter** (mantener), **obter** (obtener).",
     "@en": "The prefix changes the meaning: **ter** (have), **manter** (maintain), **obter** (get)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Ejemplos",
    "@en": "Examples"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Mantenho a calma** (mantengo la calma). **Obtive o diploma** (obtuve el diploma). **O frasco contém sal** (el frasco contiene sal). **Deteve o ladrão** (detuvo al ladrón).",
     "@en": "**Mantenho a calma** (I stay calm). **Obtive o diploma** (I got the diploma). **O frasco contém sal** (the bottle contains salt). **Deteve o ladrão** (arrested the thief)."
    }
   ]
  },
